    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover Love, Challenge Gravity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where love defies the laws of gravity! Join Mimo and Mimi, two souls separated by cosmic fears and challenges. Embark on an epic journey through inverted realms, solving puzzles, and overcoming obstacles in the quest for reconciliation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152590/extras/852f1307793f2f876a4629a641ef1a6d.avif?t=1728056264\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What would you do if you had a second chance?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everybody has this kind of luck, but Mimo and Mimi do. Will they use this opportunity to stay together this time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152590/extras/a9745857ec8dcd564a5087e5f59e4d9c.avif?t=1728056264\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotate the map, turn it upside down, and control each character in its perspective. Everything one does will affect the other's side creating challenging and unique puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152590/extras/a3ce3902c42be3a936a1a16f882636ad.avif?t=1728056264\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Face fears</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face incredible final bosses that will change the course of the level.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152590/extras/7541852946d8ae1983267506ba3f3ba2.avif?t=1728056264\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover Love, Challenge Gravity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where love defies the laws of gravity! Join Mimo and Mimi, two souls separated by cosmic fears and challenges. Embark on an epic journey through inverted realms, solving puzzles, and overcoming obstacles in the quest for reconciliation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152590/extras/852f1307793f2f876a4629a641ef1a6d.avif?t=1728056264\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What would you do if you had a second chance?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not everybody has this kind of luck, but Mimo and Mimi do. Will they use this opportunity to stay together this time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152590/extras/a9745857ec8dcd564a5087e5f59e4d9c.avif?t=1728056264\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rotate the map, turn it upside down, and control each character in its perspective. Everything one does will affect the other's side creating challenging and unique puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152590/extras/a3ce3902c42be3a936a1a16f882636ad.avif?t=1728056264\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Face fears</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face incredible final bosses that will change the course of the level.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152590/extras/7541852946d8ae1983267506ba3f3ba2.avif?t=1728056264\" data-has-big /></div></p>",
